            <ArticleTitle>Open scapula resection in beach-chair position for treatment of snapping scapula.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>249-51</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a technique of resecting the superomedial border of the scapula for treatment of &quot;snapping scapula.&quot; We have performed 5 consecutive open resections with the patient in the beach-chair position, and results have been good. This technique may be of particular benefit in patients who undergo concomitant glenohumeral arthroscopy.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
